### **May 22–25 (Post-Strategy-Change)**

| Metric | Value | Target |
|---|---|---|
| Parlay win rate | ~11% | 18–22% |
| Total Bases under win rate | 75.0% | ✅ |
| Hits over win rate | 71.4% | ✅ |
| Hits under win rate | 69.0% | ✅ |
| Strikeouts over win rate | 56.9% | ⚠️ |
| Strikeouts under win rate | 53.7% | ❌ |

**Gap analysis:** Weighted avg leg win rate ~63.6% → expected parlay win rate ~16.3%. Actual ~11% likely explained by same-game correlation on 2-leg-per-game parlays.

### **Expected Performance (Target)**
- 4-leg at 67%: 0.67^4 = **20.2% win rate**
- At +800 odds: +$81.60 per $100 → **ROI 81.6%**

